// PENDING: from an OPEN SigmaHQ pull request. Not reviewed or merged by SigmaHQ yet.
// Pull request: #6629 new: Suspicious QoS Policy Throttling Security Product Network Traffic
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6629
// Pull request author: elhoim
// Change: new rule
// Title: Suspicious QoS Policy Throttling Security Product Network Traffic
// Sigma ID: f56e9a9e-916f-4aca-8dd5-75cb4d4a7ed6
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: elhoim
// Date: 2026-11-10 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: defense-impairment, T1685
// Description: Detects the NetQos PowerShell cmdlets "New-NetQosPolicy" or "Set-NetQosPolicy" invoked with a
//   throttle rate and an application match condition that names the executable of an endpoint
//   security product. Such a policy limits the bandwidth available to the security agent and can
//   delay or prevent its telemetry and alerts from reaching the management backend. Legitimate QoS
//   policies target business applications, not security agents.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://www.zerosalarium.com/2026/06/edrchoker-choking-telemetry-stream-block-edr.html
//   - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/netqos/new-netqospolicy
//   - https://github.com/ByteRay-Labs/Query-Hub/blob/a453fcb09118894840a4e00b0db0f9807ba8441d/queries/edrchoker_qos_policy_abuse_targeting_edr_av_processes.yml
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/4ad02bfc4345b457c15fe01782616c4c244529a3/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_netqospolicy_throttle_security_product.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains "New-NetQosPolicy" or ProcessCommandLine contains "Set-NetQosPolicy") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "ThrottleRate" or ProcessCommandLine contains "-Throttle " or ProcessCommandLine contains "-maxbw") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "carbonblack" or ProcessCommandLine contains "cb.exe" or ProcessCommandLine contains "CortexXDR" or ProcessCommandLine contains "CSFalconService" or ProcessCommandLine contains "cyvera" or ProcessCommandLine contains "edragent" or ProcessCommandLine contains "elastic-agent" or ProcessCommandLine contains "elastic-endpoint" or ProcessCommandLine contains "falcon-sensor" or ProcessCommandLine contains "HarfangLab" or ProcessCommandLine contains "MsMpEng" or ProcessCommandLine contains "MsSense" or ProcessCommandLine contains "pmsu.exe" or ProcessCommandLine contains "SenseCncProxy" or ProcessCommandLine contains "SenseIR" or ProcessCommandLine contains "SentinelAgent" or ProcessCommandLine contains "SentinelService" or ProcessCommandLine contains "WinDefend")
